# Plaintext athlete data never belongs in this repo. These are minors and the
# published site is public regardless of repo visibility. Two roster files do get
# committed: public/roster.enc, which is ciphertext, and public/team.dat, which is
# scrambled first names and an initial. Neither is a full name in the clear. See
# DESIGN.md.
roster*.csv
roster*.txt
roster*.json
/rosters/
*-splits.csv

# The passphrase for public/roster.enc. That file is ciphertext and is meant to
# be committed; this is the thing that must never join it.
*passphrase*

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
